{"ID":"20240519170240-rpv07fo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240519170240-rpv07fo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519170240-rpv07fo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519170240-anzsvw0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240520104559-zdza8t9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240520104559-zdza8t9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"疫苗殺人的證據.","type":"doc","updated":"20240520104653"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240519170240-anzsvw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519170240-anzsvw0","updated":"20240520104423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"疫苗是殺人的證據(02/26/2005我於佛州撰寫)"}]},{"ID":"20240520104428-8mfi3rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520104428-8mfi3rg","updated":"20240520104428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"數週之前 , 有位來自台灣的陳小姐問我 , 她署名ㄧ為不知該如何做是好的母親敬上 , 她問我台灣之子在出生後要打許多疫苗 , 到底哪些該打? 哪些不該打? 或是全部不該打? 因為美國的西醫與中醫太爛 , 不但是一個病都看不好 , 反而把病人越治越壞 , 於是就造成我診所病人太多太忙 , 所以我當時只能很簡單的回傳一個答案給她 , 就是沒有一個是必須的 . 疫苗有多爛 , 我相信西藥廠與製作疫苗的研究人員心裡很清楚 , 但是太賺錢了 , 所以他們就黑著良心大賺黑心錢了, 現在由我們私設中醫衛生署來告訴實話民眾疫苗有多爛 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520104428-zh2fvcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520104428-zh2fvcx","updated":"20240520104428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 我先列出這位很有智慧的台灣準媽媽所寫給我的資料 , 所有台灣之子生下來以後 , 所面臨到有多少疫苗的針劑給讀者看 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520104435-azew7hz","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|||","id":"20240520104435-azew7hz","updated":"20240520104435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"適合接種年齡"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接種疫苗種類"}]},{"Type":"NodeT