Data":"日本腦炎(間隔兩週)每年三月至五月接種"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二劑"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出生滿一年六個月"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白喉,百日咳及破傷風混合疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追加"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小兒麻痺口服疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追加"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出生滿二年三個月"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日本腦炎疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三劑"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"國小一年級"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"破傷風減量白喉混合疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追加"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小兒麻痺口服疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追加"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日本腦炎疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追加"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"育齡婦女"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"德國麻疹疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一劑"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出生滿二個月"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B型流感嗜血桿菌疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一劑"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自此以下臺灣衛"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出生滿四個月"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B型流感嗜血桿菌疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二劑"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生署尚未採用此"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出生滿六個月"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B型流感嗜血桿菌疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三劑"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疫苗但是部份醫"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出生滿一年"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水痘疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一劑"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"院已經開始接種"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出生滿一年六個月"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B型流感嗜血桿菌疫苗"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"追加"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屬自費"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240520104504-6bo7jvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520104504-6bo7jvc","updated":"20240520104559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 這就是原文陳小姐傳真給我的台灣現在打疫苗的情形 , 我看到這內容後 , 很感嘆做為台灣之子好可憐 , 從小開始就被西藥廠盯上 , 被抓去打著些不但完全無用的疫苗 , 而且帶來的副做用等後遺症層出不窮 , 過去我國有一種行業叫做綠林好漢 , 如水滸傳中的人物 , 他們打劫過路商旅行人時 , 只要留下買路錢 , ㄧ般都會放人走的 , 而現在西藥廠卻是你花了錢想要健康 , 他們收了錢之後 , 卻還要你的命 , 更壞的是不是立即要你的命 , 先是造成你們身體的損傷 , 造成後再給你另外ㄧ個病名, 然後再給你其他的藥 , 然後你就ㄧ直病痛不已 , 最後因久病而厭世 , 舉凡吃西藥造成的後遺症他們ㄧ概不承認 , 他們只需要在去製造一個病名出來就可以把你說服 , 然後你就自怨自嘆 , 人類就開始短命 , 多病痛 , 過胖 , 貧困 , 不良於行 , 這種比強盜還可怕的商業行為就是目前西藥廠在使用的一貫手段 , 當然政客是他們必須要買通的第一類人 , 現任的台灣之子請看以下我所收集的資料 , 之後你再決定是否要這些小台灣之子再受到西藥的破害了 , 不過你家裡都是西醫 , 你也任用西醫做台灣衛生署長 , ㄧ直在包庇西醫 , 我看是很難說動你的 . (以下資料來源是得自Vaccines , 這本書在每國銷售目前超過100,000冊了).這是該書正面與背面的掃描 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520104640-d8t3ot8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520104640-d8t3ot8","updated":"20240520104653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240520104640-s3cxtgu.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 350px;","style":"width: 340px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240520104653-ss1yren.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 340px;\" parent-style=\"width: 350px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240520104504-uhp7fxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520104504-uhp7fxr","updated":"20240520104504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   讀者可以去買這本書來參考 , 這是一本被大眾接受且信任的一本好書 , 不知台灣有無翻譯本 , 現在我這是原文的 , 因為太忙了所以我長話短說 , 提出一些重點給讀者看 , 根據該書所列舉有關疫苗問題的資料已經嚴重到什麼程度了 ."}]},{"ID":"20240520104504-zfq6n2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520104504-zfq6n2k","updated":"20240520104504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  讀者可以參考www.thinktwice.com 進入以後點擊personal stories.就可以看到ㄧ大群受到疫苗藥害的無辜者的發聲."}]},{"ID":"20240520104510-eusaano","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520104510-eusaano","updated":"20240520104510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(待續中 , 我去吃完中藥再寫 , 因為被氣到了 , 請大家先不要注射疫苗 , 原因我會慢慢說明 , 我實在被爛醫師們搞得太忙了)"}]},{"ID":"20240520104559-zdza8t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240520104559-zdza8t9"}}]}